{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301760","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301760","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1230176001:1":{"text":"あぁ、港が封鎖されてすぐに、埠頭で仕事をしてた友達数人と海のギャングの下についたよ。海運がなきゃ仕事がなくて、食いぶちが稼げないからな！","source_cn":"封港后不久，我和几个码头干粗活的朋友一起投靠了水鬼帮。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2180D69C3B83AD38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230176002:1":{"text":"だが、こうして埠頭に戻ってきたのは俺だけだ。ほかの仲間たちは死海の艦隊にやられちまった。","source_cn":"可现在，回到这个码头的只剩下我。好多兄弟都被死潮舰队一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84283ECC1B2CFAF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230176003:1":{"text":"ラスティーアンカーを離れてる間、俺はキカバをバカにしてた。こいつ、優柔不断だろ？","source_cn":"离开锈锚港的时候，我还有些看不起奇卡瓦，因为他总是这副...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EB3223D0B444C2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230176004:1":{"text":"でも今になってみれば、腹が減ってても生きてりゃいいと思うよ。","source_cn":"可现在看来，即使饿一阵子肚子，也好过脑袋分家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8EC386FBF155DAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水鬼帮威特":{"text":"ギャングのヴェイト","source":"水鬼帮威特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}